{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round offers you a picture or description of a meme, after which you need to choose the correct answer from the options offered. For each correct answer, the player gets +1 point, and for an incorrect answer, 1 point is deducted. The peculiarity of the game is that all the images are as close as possible to the original memes, which makes the process even more recognizable and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of Russian-language Internet culture with the game &quot;MEMASIKI 2 Old Schools&quot; - an exciting quiz dedicated to the most popular and recognizable memes of the Runet. Test your knowledge of Internet folklore in a bright and stylish design!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MEMASIKI 2 Old Schools is a unique quiz that turns knowledge of Internet memes into an exciting gaming adventure. The game presents classic Russian-language memes in a completely new artistic style - bright, colorful and expressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MEMASIKI 2 Old Schools&quot; is not only entertainment, but also a cultural and educational project. The game helps to understand the context and history of the emergence of popular Internet phenomena, to study the evolution of digital culture and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ideal game for a group of friends or family leisure. Discuss the answers, share memories of how you first saw this or that meme, and discover new facets of Internet humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not just test your memory - it immerses you in the atmosphere of the era when these memes were at the peak of popularity, helps to understand their context and significance for digital culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MEMASIKI 2 Old Schools&quot; is a bridge between classic Internet culture and modern gaming art, a unique project that turns knowledge of memes into an exciting interactive adventure.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u